{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>現年25歲的黃瀅仴（Verena）是無綫（TVB）小花，曾與林映暉（暉哥）、梁超怡（Joey）、葉靖儀（Michelle）拍綜過藝節目《自然系女子旅行》。黃瀅仴日前拍片記錄台慶片段，驚爆差點弄丟廿萬珠寶！她同時又爆TVB高層揀藝人準則，原來會看一樣嘢。</p><figure><img alt=\"黃瀅仴。（ig圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260309/1107696047209189376462108.jpeg/lVOcd4lbm6kXuA56B6IOmq_37c4ws5dYQAI6SUACOkk\"/><figcaption>黃瀅仴。（ig圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"《直播靈接觸》的小編「白無常」黃瀅仴（ig@verena.wong）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260325/1113497901444632576902618.jpeg/nimfLF0kzhgPKZR0dsYxyhgT9_Fjh7JEMBUyijAVMoo\"/><figcaption>《直播靈接觸》的小編「白無常」黃瀅仴（ig@verena.wong）</figcaption></figure><p>黃瀅仴險弄丟廿萬珠寶</p><p>黃瀅仴日前以「00後TVB女藝人參加台慶，差點闖大禍！」黃瀅仴當時在台慶期間有份進行舞台表演，由排練到上台表演用足一日，之後瘋狂打卡。可是台慶期間卻發生了一個小插曲，黃瀅仴在電視城弄丟了價值20多萬的珠寶，化妝間、服裝間遍尋不獲，她直言：「死啦死啦，咁不幸嘅事要發生喺我身上嘅時候，突然我喺張枱度見度。」黃瀅仴感嘆「老天保佑」，又表示：「大家知唔知呢度幾多錢啊？」並指：「差點賠20多萬」。</p><figure><img alt=\"黃瀅仴（Verena）不時曬好身材。（IG：@verena.wong）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20241112/932983818607398912916825.jpeg/rB1EbGdTLd8Nvo_iR-rC4FR7Uvqb53IQINWidSDVonU\"/><figcaption>黃瀅仴（Verena）不時曬好身材。（IG：@verena.wong）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"黃瀅仴（Verena）不時曬長腿。（IG：@verena.wong）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20241112/932983816585613312895732.jpeg/DNluWo7KYQBtTlynFpTEi1WBGTF9DIxuzYMI8M2DCPA\"/><figcaption>黃瀅仴（Verena）不時曬長腿。（IG：@verena.wong）</figcaption></figure><p>爆TVB高層揀藝人準則</p><p>黃瀅仴台慶前要先拍TVB形象照，她精心打扮，並透露高層揀人準則，她說：「呢張相非常之重要，因為佢會喺我哋TVB官網、或者高層揀人嘅時候就會睇呢張相，所以我哋每年都會嚟Update吓呢張相。」</p><figure><img alt=\"黃瀅仴在台慶險弄丟廿萬珠寶。（小紅書@黃瀅仴WoWo）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261126/1202661557876559872137654.png/VJzDCubnRT2pT88lDJqeoXtvriieQSyZQnexgUJ3sYE\"/><figcaption>黃瀅仴在台慶險弄丟廿萬珠寶。（小紅書@黃瀅仴WoWo）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"黃瀅仴最後在枱上找到。（小紅書@黃瀅仴WoWo）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261126/1202661571319828480475920.png/FMun494AVfqgsTrgvWVN6AkGFwUcOgyoO6t7wzure8M\"/><figcaption>黃瀅仴最後在枱上找到。（小紅書@黃瀅仴WoWo）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"黃瀅仴爆TVB高層挑人會看形象照。（小紅書@黃瀅仴WoWo）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261126/1202661568970887168671592.png/_pzuuDgGAJgK3tZJryrYNjvHmQNkiFxIbypL628qS-s\"/><figcaption>黃瀅仴爆TVB高層挑人會看形象照。（小紅書@黃瀅仴WoWo）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"黃瀅仴瘦身成功。（小紅書@黃瀅仴WoWo）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261126/1202661566605168640607914.png/5HXytDn54VZAaY6LqueKZ_wjpzfLbgouBko7FwZKOxc\"/><figcaption>黃瀅仴瘦身成功。（小紅書@黃瀅仴WoWo）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"黃瀅仴身材出眾。（小紅書@黃瀅仴WoWo）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261126/1202661564046512128469082.png/iLPW7SV1iKR5gwpO8I7NEKRhmeRRyA11pEAZD6RAGQ8\"/><figcaption>黃瀅仴身材出眾。（小紅書@黃瀅仴WoWo）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"黃瀅仴跳舞。（小紅書@黃瀅仴WoWo）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261126/1202661561462689792514693.png/5Lczw3RCx14LO10eBlxCqT46oFJQGH0BruA06K7gNOg\"/><figcaption>黃瀅仴跳舞。（小紅書@黃瀅仴WoWo）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"黃瀅仴跳舞。（小紅書@黃瀅仴WoWo）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261126/1202661568375427072946785.png/rzo5hOzh1cjAKTIs2ovnPYEaZZRiM_VoDnSQHg50kB4\"/><figcaption>黃瀅仴跳舞。（小紅書@黃瀅仴WoWo）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"黃瀅仴與藝人合照。（小紅書@黃瀅仴WoWo）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261126/1202661566328475648265130.png/Zy3C5EEagow10gFy-Pgi1p7sTV0EpRmNXisFBV4rBQU\"/><figcaption>黃瀅仴與藝人合照。（小紅書@黃瀅仴WoWo）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"黃瀅仴圈中好友眾多。（小紅書@黃瀅仴WoWo）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261126/1202661564004700160107946.png/ndco8MUMCiZEfquk5BgrCpGh6FZWVZImxoilusaIpbo\"/><figcaption>黃瀅仴圈中好友眾多。（小紅書@黃瀅仴WoWo）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"黃瀅仴打卡。（小紅書@黃瀅仴WoWo）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261126/1202661561739644928741890.png/eq89Ph_Qfv3NGKQgjgkDiYFxwBvnwW5xdhpexHYaXsQ\"/><figcaption>黃瀅仴打卡。（小紅書@黃瀅仴WoWo）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"黃瀅仴分享台慶驚險事。（小紅書@黃瀅仴WoWo）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261126/1202661559524921344094352.png/EzFYyOjlwfPWKXa--77sr7YBIEp2KvJVtrBDgbawQ4E\"/><figcaption>黃瀅仴分享台慶驚險事。（小紅書@黃瀅仴WoWo）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T15:23:54.162687+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":818,"images":15,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T15:00:17+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T15:37:28.966822+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T15:17:25.556242+00:00","content_hash":"adf8841f14bf91066aab01cab5092b617c23c7024b306ca4e998372c22f9c2b8","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}